              after all. (Constructively, this is enough to show that the classical theorem has no counterexample.)
          %p There is also another constructively valid version of the IVT, where the conclusion is classically the contrapositive of the classical IVT, but which is weaker constructively since the reverse contrapositive rule does not hold constructively:
          .num_theorem
